
  # Ditto CLI Manual 📖

  Welcome to Ditto. This guide sticks to what the TUI
  actually does right now.

  ## Starting the app 🚀

  • Run **ditto-cli tui** to open the full terminal UI.
  • Run **ditto-cli** without a subcommand when you
  want the root help and command list.

  ## Navigation 🕹️

  • **j / k** or **Up / Down**: Move through lists and
  comments.
  • **gg / G**: Jump to the top / bottom of lists.
  • **H / M / L**: Jump to the high / middle / low
